Package: leeward
Title: Terrain Wind Exposure and Campsite Suitability
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Mark", "Oleson", , "leewardMaintain@proton.me", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes terrain-based wind exposure from a digital elevation
    model and a local wind climatology, using direction-frequency weighted
    upwind terrain indices (Winstral Sx) or distance-limited TOPEX. Planned extensions combine
    exposure with slope, water, vegetation, soils, and land status into a
    campsite suitability layer that flags candidate areas to scout.
